1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:04,587
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:05,505 --> 00:00:06,673
[gunshots]

3
00:00:06,756 --> 00:00:07,966
[gun clicks, fires]

4
00:00:09,426 --> 00:00:10,677
[whoosh, slashing sounds]

5
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,679
[machine gun fire]

6
00:00:12,762 --> 00:00:14,681
[machine gun fire continues]

7
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:15,765
[single gunshot]

8
00:00:17,976 --> 00:00:20,395
[rapid gunfire]

9
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:22,397
[echoing blast]

10
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,107
[rapid gunfire]

11
00:00:24,858 --> 00:00:25,942
[blade whooshing]

12
00:00:26,025 --> 00:00:28,445
[tense music builds]

13
00:00:28,528 --> 00:00:29,696
[blade whooshing]

14
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:36,161
<i>You should be proud of your daughter</i>

15
00:00:36,244 --> 00:00:40,290
<i>because Emilia shot Raul herself!</i>

16
00:00:40,373 --> 00:00:44,461
<i>Raul was wearing the Jaguar's mask</i>
<i>when she shot him.</i>

17
00:00:44,544 --> 00:00:48,840
[Emilia] <i>I'll kill you both,</i>
<i>Lily and Camia Cruz!</i>

18
00:00:50,091 --> 00:00:51,634
<i>You bastards!</i>

19
00:00:51,718 --> 00:00:55,722
<i>You've killed everyone that I love!</i>
<i>What more do you want?!</i>

20
00:00:55,805 --> 00:00:58,099
[Julio] <i>Raul was never a threat to me!</i>

21
00:00:58,183 --> 00:01:00,435
<i>That's why I never wasted time on him!</i>

22
00:01:00,518 --> 00:01:02,145
<i>I could have killed him just like that.</i>

23
00:01:02,228 --> 00:01:05,815
<i>Just like you. I could get rid of you</i>
<i>at any given time.</i>

24
00:01:05,899 --> 00:01:09,027
<i>Girls. Take Julio with you.</i>

25
00:01:09,110 --> 00:01:10,904
<i>Please handle him with care</i>

26
00:01:10,987 --> 00:01:14,783
<i>because you know how brittle</i>
<i>his bones are.</i>

27
00:01:14,866 --> 00:01:16,534
[Lily] <i>You were the one</i>
<i>guarding my mother.</i>

28
00:01:18,536 --> 00:01:19,996
<i>I'm coming, Mom.</i>

29
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,831
[Helena] <i>What a surprise</i>
<i>to see you, Lily Cruz!</i>

30
00:01:21,915 --> 00:01:26,252
-[gunshot]
-<i>Finally, I get to kill you myself!</i>

31
00:01:28,338 --> 00:01:30,048
-[Helena grunts]
-[thumps]

32
00:01:32,425 --> 00:01:34,719
[Lily] <i>Emilia! Let's meet!</i>

33
00:01:34,803 --> 00:01:37,680
<i>Your mother in exchange for my mother!</i>

34
00:01:38,348 --> 00:01:40,767
<i>Diego. Uncle Damian.</i>

35
00:01:41,226 --> 00:01:43,186
<i>Thank God, you're alive.</i>

36
00:01:43,269 --> 00:01:44,187
<i>Lower your gun.</i>

37
00:01:44,270 --> 00:01:46,439
<i>Emilia and I will trade hostages.</i>

38
00:01:46,523 --> 00:01:50,777
<i>After that, I'll kill this witch myself!</i>

39
00:01:56,699 --> 00:01:59,452
-Is this enough?
-Dig deeper.

40
00:01:59,536 --> 00:02:01,746
Red Dragon wants a deeper grave for him,

41
00:02:01,830 --> 00:02:04,499
so that geezer is closer to hell.

42
00:02:44,998 --> 00:02:46,040
That's enough!

43
00:02:47,625 --> 00:02:48,877
Bury the old man.

44
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:51,921
Go.

45
00:02:52,422 --> 00:02:53,464
Help them.

46
00:03:00,221 --> 00:03:01,347
[gunshots]

47
00:03:02,807 --> 00:03:05,184
-[Arnaldo] Not so fast.
-[grunts]

48
00:03:07,186 --> 00:03:08,688
-Sorry.
-[gunshot]

49
00:03:16,946 --> 00:03:18,781
She's dead. She's dead.

50
00:03:19,490 --> 00:03:21,618
Wow! Thank you.

51
00:03:22,452 --> 00:03:24,746
Thank you for your loyal service.

52
00:03:26,331 --> 00:03:27,373
[gunshot]

53
00:03:36,466 --> 00:03:38,009
And what about you?

54
00:03:38,343 --> 00:03:40,720
[scoffs] Looks like you had a long day.

55
00:03:41,930 --> 00:03:43,556
Don't worry, I'm here to save you.

56
00:03:45,725 --> 00:03:46,893
Okay.

57
00:03:52,065 --> 00:03:53,900
-Relax.
-[grunts]

58
00:03:56,778 --> 00:03:58,571
[gasps loudly and coughs]

59
00:03:58,655 --> 00:04:00,073
I'm here. I'm here.

60
00:04:02,242 --> 00:04:03,576
Relax, I'm here. I'm here.

61
00:04:05,536 --> 00:04:07,538
Are you good? You okay?

62
00:04:07,997 --> 00:04:08,957
Yeah.

63
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:11,084
[chuckles]

64
00:04:11,626 --> 00:04:12,752
Now…

65
00:04:12,835 --> 00:04:17,298
Now, where is that witch, Helena Montoya?!

66
00:04:17,548 --> 00:04:19,968
-I am going to kill her!
-[Arnaldo chuckling]

67
00:04:20,551 --> 00:04:22,720
And if she survives, I'll kill her again.

68
00:04:23,263 --> 00:04:26,099
Relax, Grandpa. We'll look for them.

69
00:04:26,182 --> 00:04:27,850
Thank you. Thank you.

70
00:04:27,934 --> 00:04:29,102
[Arnaldo] I got you.

71
00:04:59,007 --> 00:05:00,049
Mom!

72
00:05:15,648 --> 00:05:19,485
-Let Mama go!
-You first!

73
00:05:24,824 --> 00:05:26,284
Let's do this at the same time!

74
00:05:29,954 --> 00:05:30,955
Fine!

75
00:05:31,664 --> 00:05:36,002
[tense music playing]

76
00:06:39,941 --> 00:06:45,947
[tense music intensifies]

77
00:07:22,358 --> 00:07:23,401
It's an ambush!

78
00:07:25,027 --> 00:07:26,404
It's an ambush, baby girl! Shoot them!

79
00:07:26,487 --> 00:07:27,989
-Uncle Damian and--
-Ambush!

80
00:07:28,072 --> 00:07:29,574
Shoot them, baby girl! Shoot them!

81
00:07:32,618 --> 00:07:34,829
-Mama!
-Time to die, Lily Cruz!

82
00:07:35,830 --> 00:07:36,831
[gunshot]

83
00:07:39,041 --> 00:07:40,084
[Lily grunts]

84
00:07:41,461 --> 00:07:42,712
-Mama.
-Lily!

85
00:07:43,004 --> 00:07:44,922
Lily! Lily!

86
00:07:45,715 --> 00:07:47,091
-Lily!
-[gunshots]

87
00:07:47,175 --> 00:07:48,509
[grunts]

88
00:07:52,388 --> 00:07:55,808
[foreboding music]

89
00:07:59,812 --> 00:08:02,023
[Emilia] Mama!

90
00:08:04,942 --> 00:08:09,238
-[rapid gunfire]
-[Camia screaming]

91
00:08:09,530 --> 00:08:11,157
-[Camia] Lily!
-[gunshot]

92
00:08:11,491 --> 00:08:14,368
-[wailing]
-[gunshots]

93
00:08:14,452 --> 00:08:16,412
[rapid gunfire]

94
00:08:16,496 --> 00:08:20,124
[Emilia] Mama!

95
00:08:20,208 --> 00:08:23,336
-[rapid gunfire]
-[Emilia wailing]

96
00:08:23,419 --> 00:08:29,217
[rapid gunfire]

97
00:08:33,971 --> 00:08:36,891
Mama!

98
00:08:38,809 --> 00:08:40,478
[rapid gunfire]

99
00:08:42,813 --> 00:08:43,648
[screams]

100
00:08:47,818 --> 00:08:49,403
-[gunshots]
-[man grunts]

101
00:08:53,241 --> 00:08:55,743
-[Camia whimpering]
-Diego!

102
00:09:00,957 --> 00:09:02,875
[Camia whimpering]

103
00:09:08,130 --> 00:09:11,133
[Emilia whimpering]

104
00:09:11,217 --> 00:09:13,010
-[Camia] Lily! Lily!
-[Diego] Lily!

105
00:09:16,472 --> 00:09:18,599
[Camia] Hurry up, Diego! Hurry!

106
00:09:24,647 --> 00:09:27,316
[Emilia whimpering]

107
00:09:28,568 --> 00:09:31,362
Mama!

108
00:09:32,113 --> 00:09:33,197
Mama!

109
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:41,080
[Emilia] Be careful.
Please take care of my mama.

110
00:09:41,163 --> 00:09:43,249
-[Helena] Emilia.
-[Emilia] Mama!

111
00:09:45,668 --> 00:09:46,627
Papa!

112
00:09:46,711 --> 00:09:48,879
[Julio] It's all right, Emilia!
Just stay there!

113
00:09:49,463 --> 00:09:51,007
Ronald, stay with my daughter.

114
00:09:51,841 --> 00:09:53,467
Stay there. I'll take care of things here.

115
00:09:53,551 --> 00:09:54,635
[Helena] Julio.

116
00:10:01,851 --> 00:10:02,935
[Damian] Boss.

117
00:10:46,228 --> 00:10:47,480
-[Helena] Julio?
-Yes?

118
00:10:47,563 --> 00:10:48,648
[groaning]

119
00:10:48,731 --> 00:10:50,191
What are you doing here?

120
00:10:50,274 --> 00:10:52,693
I'm here for you.

121
00:10:52,777 --> 00:10:55,613
I am worried about you.
Can't you see that?

122
00:10:56,364 --> 00:10:58,366
-Of course, I worry about you.
-No.

123
00:10:59,533 --> 00:11:01,118
Here I am.

124
00:11:03,204 --> 00:11:04,622
Helena, Helena,

125
00:11:06,082 --> 00:11:10,961
some people just don't and cannot change,

126
00:11:12,213 --> 00:11:15,591
then and until now, just like you,

127
00:11:16,801 --> 00:11:18,386
you're still a fraud.

128
00:11:19,053 --> 00:11:20,805
No, Julio.

129
00:11:21,764 --> 00:11:23,099
I didn't fool you.

130
00:11:23,557 --> 00:11:26,143
You fooled yourself. I loved you.

131
00:11:26,227 --> 00:11:29,105
[Julio] Shh! Shh! Shh!

132
00:11:30,940 --> 00:11:34,402
No matter what you say or do,

133
00:11:35,444 --> 00:11:37,738
it won't change your fate.

134
00:11:38,364 --> 00:11:39,907
This is your destiny.

135
00:11:41,534 --> 00:11:42,660
You know why?

136
00:11:43,536 --> 00:11:46,872
It's because you messed
with the wrong Ardiente.

137
00:11:46,956 --> 00:11:48,791
-You messed with me.
-[clicks tongue]

138
00:11:51,961 --> 00:11:56,048
-Helena, now, don't you worry.
-[Helena sobbing]

139
00:11:56,132 --> 00:11:57,758
Julio, please, no.

140
00:11:57,842 --> 00:12:01,470
[Julio] I want you to know
that I will always love you.

141
00:12:01,554 --> 00:12:02,596
Okay?

142
00:12:03,389 --> 00:12:05,891
[whimpering] No… No.

143
00:12:05,975 --> 00:12:08,227
-[smooches]
-[Helena] No.

144
00:12:09,103 --> 00:12:12,606
Excuse me, please take her
to the hospital.

145
00:12:12,690 --> 00:12:15,943
-I think she's delirious.
-No! No!

146
00:12:16,026 --> 00:12:17,528
She's babbling words.

147
00:12:17,611 --> 00:12:20,489
-[Helena] No! No! No!
-Take care of her!

148
00:12:20,573 --> 00:12:21,866
Make sure she's okay.

149
00:12:23,367 --> 00:12:25,035
-Ronald!
-[Helena] No!

150
00:12:25,119 --> 00:12:26,162
[Julio] Help me.

151
00:12:27,121 --> 00:12:28,414
[Helena] No!

152
00:12:30,458 --> 00:12:31,459
[sighs]

153
00:12:31,542 --> 00:12:33,002
-[Emilia] Papa!
-[Julio] My God.

154
00:12:34,128 --> 00:12:35,463
[Emilia] Papa.

155
00:12:35,546 --> 00:12:37,173
[Julio] Your mom is okay.
She's gonna be okay.

156
00:12:37,256 --> 00:12:39,467
She's just a bit delirious. I don't know.

157
00:12:39,550 --> 00:12:42,720
Maybe because of the medication
that was given to her.

158
00:12:43,262 --> 00:12:45,764
But she'll be all right.
She'll be all right.

159
00:12:45,848 --> 00:12:46,807
Don't worry.

160
00:12:46,891 --> 00:12:53,022
[ambulance siren wailing]

161
00:12:56,901 --> 00:12:58,360
[snivels]

162
00:13:03,407 --> 00:13:07,661
[loud explosion]

163
00:13:16,712 --> 00:13:19,757
Mama!

164
00:13:36,148 --> 00:13:41,779
[wailing]

165
00:13:51,580 --> 00:13:53,374
[Emilia whimpering]

166
00:14:42,673 --> 00:14:44,550
Believe me, Emilia.

167
00:14:47,011 --> 00:14:51,015
Lily Cruz planted a bomb
in your mother's ambulance.

168
00:14:53,934 --> 00:14:55,227
Lily Cruz…

169
00:14:56,145 --> 00:14:57,813
murdered her!

170
00:14:59,940 --> 00:15:02,776
And we're going to avenge Helena.

171
00:15:05,738 --> 00:15:06,780
That's a promise.

172
00:15:25,132 --> 00:15:30,429
[foreboding music playing]

173
00:15:32,556 --> 00:15:33,974
Did you hear that, Mama?

174
00:15:36,977 --> 00:15:38,312
Papa said…

175
00:15:39,897 --> 00:15:41,231
that he'll avenge you.

176
00:15:43,692 --> 00:15:45,444
Because he loves you so much.

177
00:15:49,657 --> 00:15:50,824
And I love you too.

178
00:15:58,958 --> 00:16:00,417
Lily Cruz…

179
00:16:02,962 --> 00:16:06,590
took away the only person
that I loved most.

180
00:16:11,136 --> 00:16:13,347
So now, I am going to kill

181
00:16:14,974 --> 00:16:17,893
all her loved ones.

182
00:16:21,438 --> 00:16:26,485
[foreboding music playing]

183
00:16:47,464 --> 00:16:52,511
[soft dramatic music playing]

184
00:17:17,369 --> 00:17:18,412
Lily.

185
00:17:34,470 --> 00:17:38,474
[weeping]

186
00:18:17,429 --> 00:18:21,725
[whimpering]

187
00:18:24,937 --> 00:18:25,979
Dad…

188
00:18:30,275 --> 00:18:31,819
Dad, I love you so much.

189
00:18:36,949 --> 00:18:38,742
My father did many mistakes.

190
00:18:43,622 --> 00:18:46,041
But he still tried to do the right thing.

191
00:18:49,837 --> 00:18:50,879
I know…

192
00:18:52,214 --> 00:18:53,340
I know it's not enough

193
00:18:53,423 --> 00:18:55,676
to make up for everything
he'd done to you.

194
00:18:58,303 --> 00:19:00,430
But on his behalf,

195
00:19:02,558 --> 00:19:03,642
Lily,

196
00:19:05,102 --> 00:19:06,228
Aunt Camia,

197
00:19:07,980 --> 00:19:09,398
I hope one day…

198
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:13,652
I hope you can forgive my father.

199
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:12,002
-[Marlon] Anna, how are they?
-They're safe.

200
00:20:13,003 --> 00:20:14,004
Then why…

201
00:20:15,339 --> 00:20:16,757
Are you okay? What happened?

202
00:20:17,966 --> 00:20:20,302
Anna, are you all right?

203
00:20:20,928 --> 00:20:22,971
I just really need a hug, Marlon.

204
00:20:24,264 --> 00:20:28,602
[soft romantic music playing]

205
00:21:13,105 --> 00:21:17,651
[foreboding music]

206
00:21:18,902 --> 00:21:21,947
-[whimpering]
-Dad! Dad!

207
00:21:22,990 --> 00:21:26,702
Dad! Dad! Dad!

208
00:21:26,785 --> 00:21:29,246
[whimpering]

209
00:21:31,206 --> 00:21:32,207
Dad!

210
00:21:33,417 --> 00:21:37,087
Who did this to you?! Dad! Dad!

211
00:21:44,219 --> 00:21:46,847
Dad! Dad!

212
00:21:54,730 --> 00:21:55,772
Dad!

213
00:21:56,898 --> 00:21:57,941
[Diego] Brother.

214
00:21:58,984 --> 00:22:00,027
Diego!

215
00:22:03,572 --> 00:22:05,741
We need to be strong, brother.

216
00:22:07,659 --> 00:22:10,787
I am here for you.

217
00:22:12,414 --> 00:22:13,457
Thank you.

218
00:22:14,958 --> 00:22:16,168
Thank you, Diego.

219
00:22:17,336 --> 00:22:18,462
Thank you.

220
00:22:18,545 --> 00:22:22,591
I don't know why this happened.
Maybe there's a reason.

221
00:22:23,675 --> 00:22:24,760
Maybe there's a reason.

222
00:22:25,927 --> 00:22:29,848
Maybe his death will bring us together.

223
00:22:31,975 --> 00:22:33,018
We'll get through this.

224
00:22:35,687 --> 00:22:37,981
-I'm here and I won't leave you.
-[Arnaldo] Thank you.

225
00:22:40,650 --> 00:22:42,069
[whimpers]

226
00:22:53,080 --> 00:22:58,502
[soft dramatic music playing]

227
00:23:00,128 --> 00:23:01,171
[pants]

228
00:23:07,135 --> 00:23:09,596
<i>-You're more beautiful up close.</i>
<i>-Don't touch me!</i>

229
00:23:10,430 --> 00:23:12,265
<i>Sir! Sir! Let me go!</i>

230
00:23:13,600 --> 00:23:16,061
[Raul] <i>I saved your life, Camia.</i>

231
00:23:16,144 --> 00:23:18,313
[Camia] Raul, you already killed me

232
00:23:18,396 --> 00:23:20,690
by locking me up for years!

233
00:23:21,566 --> 00:23:26,154
You are the root
of my family's misfortunes!

234
00:23:26,238 --> 00:23:28,198
Raul, why are you doing this?

235
00:23:28,824 --> 00:23:31,785
Camia, let me make up
for everything I did.

236
00:23:52,806 --> 00:23:53,849
Mom.

237
00:23:58,019 --> 00:23:59,020
[Camia snivels]

238
00:24:08,905 --> 00:24:11,241
We are here to support Diego.

239
00:24:14,411 --> 00:24:16,580
I'm only here for Diego.

240
00:24:19,374 --> 00:24:21,418
Even though Raul is dead,

241
00:24:22,752 --> 00:24:24,629
I still can't forgive him.

242
00:24:26,756 --> 00:24:28,049
I can't forgive him

243
00:24:28,133 --> 00:24:30,260
because he's the root of all this.

244
00:24:32,888 --> 00:24:37,642
The death of my father is his fault.

245
00:24:39,811 --> 00:24:42,230
It's his fault that we got separated.

246
00:24:42,814 --> 00:24:45,859
It's his fault my family was torn apart.

247
00:24:49,863 --> 00:24:52,115
That's why I will never forgive him.

248
00:24:55,076 --> 00:24:57,120
I want to forgive.

249
00:24:58,038 --> 00:25:00,248
I really want to, but…

250
00:25:01,666 --> 00:25:02,792
but I just…

251
00:25:06,004 --> 00:25:07,005
Lily.

252
00:25:11,343 --> 00:25:13,220
He saved me.

253
00:25:17,224 --> 00:25:19,476
Raul saved me, Lily.

254
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:28,443
Lily…

255
00:25:30,820 --> 00:25:33,073
I want to bury the past,

256
00:25:33,490 --> 00:25:37,953
all my anger and pain towards him.

257
00:25:41,248 --> 00:25:44,167
-I want to forget it all.
-[whimpering]

258
00:25:49,256 --> 00:25:51,216
Someone told me…

259
00:25:52,801 --> 00:25:55,512
that if someone asks for forgiveness,

260
00:25:56,471 --> 00:26:02,269
especially if that person is sincere

261
00:26:03,103 --> 00:26:05,021
we should forgive him with our hearts.

262
00:26:06,940 --> 00:26:08,858
Not just for their sake,

263
00:26:10,110 --> 00:26:12,112
but for us to heal as well.

264
00:26:15,282 --> 00:26:18,535
I am also grateful to Raul.

265
00:26:20,829 --> 00:26:21,705
Because…

266
00:26:22,706 --> 00:26:25,542
he tried to correct his past mistakes.

267
00:26:29,254 --> 00:26:32,465
So, we should learn to forgive.

268
00:26:35,093 --> 00:26:38,972
At least, it eases the pain
of what he did to your father

269
00:26:40,515 --> 00:26:41,975
and to our family.

270
00:26:47,272 --> 00:26:48,315
Lily.

271
00:27:05,373 --> 00:27:08,001
[soft dramatic music playing]

272
00:27:23,516 --> 00:27:24,934
[Anna] <i>Isn't it obvious?!</i>

273
00:27:25,643 --> 00:27:29,105
<i>Jepoy, I like you. I like you.</i>

274
00:27:29,606 --> 00:27:31,066
<i>I really like you, Anna!</i>

275
00:27:31,149 --> 00:27:33,693
<i>You're always in my head and in my heart!</i>

276
00:27:33,943 --> 00:27:35,403
<i>Is there still a room for me in there?</i>

277
00:27:35,695 --> 00:27:38,114
[Anna] <i>You're always in my heart, Jepoy.</i>

278
00:27:38,406 --> 00:27:40,533
<i>-Don't leave my side.</i>
<i>-I won't.</i>

279
00:27:40,617 --> 00:27:41,951
-[Jepoy] <i>Promise?</i>
-[Anna] <i>Promise.</i>

280
00:27:42,410 --> 00:27:43,453
<i>Jepoy.</i>

281
00:27:45,538 --> 00:27:48,166
[Jepoy] <i>I didn't mean to.</i>
<i>I didn't mean to.</i>

282
00:27:48,249 --> 00:27:50,752
[Anna] <i>You didn't mean to?!</i>

283
00:27:51,628 --> 00:27:55,298
<i>You didn't mean to fool around</i>
<i>and hurt me, Jepoy?!</i>

284
00:28:07,227 --> 00:28:10,605
[Jepoy] <i>I will never love anyone</i>
<i>the way that I love you, Anna.</i>

285
00:28:18,696 --> 00:28:19,739
[engine revs]

286
00:28:26,496 --> 00:28:28,039
[handbrake squeaks]

287
00:28:36,673 --> 00:28:41,803
-[phone dialing]
-[hangs up]

288
00:28:42,762 --> 00:28:45,140
Why aren't you answering, Madrigal?!

289
00:28:50,228 --> 00:28:55,650
-[phone dialing]
-[hangs up]

290
00:28:55,734 --> 00:28:56,776
[scoffs]

291
00:28:57,318 --> 00:28:59,237
Why aren't you answering?!

292
00:29:04,159 --> 00:29:05,827
[Natalie] <i>Oh, Madrigal.</i>

293
00:29:06,828 --> 00:29:08,788
<i>Why am I worried about you?</i>

294
00:29:09,789 --> 00:29:13,626
<i>You know, I've had a lot of men</i>
<i>for a lot of reasons.</i>

295
00:29:13,710 --> 00:29:16,963
<i>All of them ended up leaving me.</i>

296
00:29:17,547 --> 00:29:20,967
<i>I don't care if they burn in hell.</i>

297
00:29:21,468 --> 00:29:23,303
<i>But you, Madrigal,</i>

298
00:29:24,429 --> 00:29:26,723
<i>I don't want anything bad</i>
<i>to happen to you.</i>

299
00:29:30,518 --> 00:29:31,519
<i>You're different.</i>

300
00:29:32,437 --> 00:29:37,400
<i>I want you to choose me.</i>

301
00:29:37,484 --> 00:29:41,946
<i>And I've never wanted anyone</i>
<i>as much as I want you.</i>

302
00:29:42,864 --> 00:29:43,907
[handbrake squeaks]

303
00:29:53,166 --> 00:29:54,167
[handbrake squeaks]

304
00:30:00,298 --> 00:30:06,805
[soft dramatic music playing]

305
00:30:23,780 --> 00:30:26,032
[Damian] <i>I learned to love because of you.</i>

306
00:30:30,036 --> 00:30:32,956
<i>I want to be a good person because of you.</i>

307
00:30:45,385 --> 00:30:48,847
[Camia] Jay, we should install
cameras here,

308
00:30:48,930 --> 00:30:50,765
so we can monitor the front gate.

309
00:30:50,849 --> 00:30:52,308
We should put one in the corner too.

310
00:30:52,767 --> 00:30:56,271
Relay it to the security personnel.

311
00:30:57,355 --> 00:30:59,941
[Damian] <i>You deserve</i>
<i>someone better than me.</i>

312
00:31:02,026 --> 00:31:03,820
<i>Am I worthy of you?</i>

313
00:31:06,447 --> 00:31:08,283
[Camia] Do we have cameras in that area?

314
00:31:08,366 --> 00:31:09,993
Yeah, I think we're good.

315
00:31:26,801 --> 00:31:27,802
Damian.

316
00:31:42,317 --> 00:31:44,152
It's good that you've moved
to a new house.

317
00:31:45,320 --> 00:31:47,614
We need to leave the old house,

318
00:31:47,947 --> 00:31:50,658
so we could bury its tragic memories.

319
00:31:52,827 --> 00:31:54,579
I just want to assure your safety.

320
00:31:56,497 --> 00:31:58,708
Damian, we're safe because of you,

321
00:32:00,168 --> 00:32:01,711
also to Diego and Raul.

322
00:32:03,296 --> 00:32:07,091
I will be forever grateful to you three.

323
00:32:10,053 --> 00:32:11,179
But Damian,

324
00:32:12,805 --> 00:32:15,141
you need to own up to your mistakes.

325
00:32:18,311 --> 00:32:19,354
I know.

326
00:32:22,106 --> 00:32:23,775
I'm turning myself in.

327
00:32:27,445 --> 00:32:31,991
I will pay for all my crimes,
so I can be worthy of your love.

328
00:32:32,241 --> 00:32:35,995
[soft dramatic music playing]

329
00:32:50,969 --> 00:32:53,596
I hope this isn't the last time
that we can be together.

330
00:32:59,185 --> 00:33:00,186
I hope…

331
00:33:03,064 --> 00:33:04,899
I hope you can wait for me, Camia.

332
00:33:13,825 --> 00:33:14,951
Damian.

333
00:33:28,923 --> 00:33:30,091
I'll wait for you.

334
00:33:31,676 --> 00:33:33,177
I'll wait for you, Damian.

335
00:34:33,946 --> 00:34:36,949
-Does it hurt?
-Not much.

336
00:34:40,078 --> 00:34:44,123
[romantic music playing]

337
00:34:53,925 --> 00:34:55,176
Life comes so fast.

338
00:34:58,304 --> 00:34:59,347
Just recently…

339
00:35:02,308 --> 00:35:03,976
I lost Auntie and Uncle.

340
00:35:07,939 --> 00:35:08,981
And now, I lost Dad.

341
00:35:12,902 --> 00:35:13,945
It's scary.

342
00:35:15,947 --> 00:35:17,865
You never know when your time will come.

343
00:35:24,580 --> 00:35:29,418
I know I haven't really shown you
how much I love you.

344
00:35:31,629 --> 00:35:33,172
But that will never happen again.

345
00:35:37,385 --> 00:35:40,096
I'll show you every single day, Diego,

346
00:35:41,472 --> 00:35:43,015
how much I love you.

347
00:35:50,356 --> 00:35:52,150
We can't afford to surrender.

348
00:35:54,652 --> 00:35:56,404
But whenever I think about the danger,

349
00:35:57,613 --> 00:35:59,615
the revenge of the Ardientes,

350
00:36:02,368 --> 00:36:03,703
will we ever find peace?

351
00:36:05,204 --> 00:36:07,290
When will this end?

352
00:36:08,958 --> 00:36:12,170
-Lily, what if we don't make--
-[Lily] We'll make it through.

353
00:36:14,589 --> 00:36:17,049
We have a future, Diego.

354
00:36:17,675 --> 00:36:20,678
My love for you, your love for me,

355
00:36:20,761 --> 00:36:23,347
and our love for each other

356
00:36:23,431 --> 00:36:25,808
will give us strength and hope

357
00:36:26,601 --> 00:36:29,395
for a brighter future.

358
00:36:37,945 --> 00:36:38,988
I love you.

359
00:36:41,991 --> 00:36:43,075
I love you too.

360
00:36:44,243 --> 00:36:49,207
[soft romantic music playing]

361
00:37:13,940 --> 00:37:14,941
[Jepoy] My goodness.

362
00:37:16,817 --> 00:37:18,069
What are you doing here?

363
00:37:19,362 --> 00:37:20,613
Where have you been?!

364
00:37:21,155 --> 00:37:24,408
I've been calling you,
but you weren't picking up.

365
00:37:25,701 --> 00:37:26,744
Why?!

366
00:37:28,287 --> 00:37:29,455
Lily went missing.

367
00:37:30,873 --> 00:37:33,876
The Ardientes kidnapped her,
so I was busy tracking them.

368
00:37:34,669 --> 00:37:37,171
-Not now, I'm tired.
-Wow!

369
00:37:37,922 --> 00:37:43,803
Well, you could have answered
my call and told me that.

370
00:37:44,136 --> 00:37:46,264
[Jepoy] And why do I need to inform you?

371
00:37:46,347 --> 00:37:49,684
Because I'm your boss
and you are my henchman.

372
00:37:49,767 --> 00:37:52,895
I should know where you are
every single time.

373
00:37:52,979 --> 00:37:55,398
[Jepoy] Yeah, you're my boss
and I'm your henchman.

374
00:37:55,815 --> 00:37:58,109
But I'm not your puppet. And besides…

375
00:37:58,192 --> 00:38:00,945
Well, I own you. Have you forgotten?

376
00:38:02,071 --> 00:38:03,239
What's with me?!

377
00:38:04,156 --> 00:38:07,118
Why do you keep bothering me?!
What's with me, huh?!

378
00:38:07,827 --> 00:38:11,372
-Do you really wanna know?!
-Yeah! Tell me!

379
00:38:11,998 --> 00:38:13,124
I love you!

380
00:38:15,126 --> 00:38:16,168
[scoffs]

381
00:38:16,585 --> 00:38:17,795
I love you!

382
00:38:20,381 --> 00:38:21,424
[whimpers]

383
00:38:22,091 --> 00:38:23,968
I love you, Jepoy!

384
00:38:24,427 --> 00:38:26,637
-I love you, Madrigal!
-Ma'am.

385
00:38:27,847 --> 00:38:29,348
How many times do I have to…

386
00:38:35,021 --> 00:38:36,022
[Natalie whimpers]

387
00:38:36,939 --> 00:38:41,235
I thought, I could never love like this.

388
00:38:44,780 --> 00:38:45,906
<i>But you're different.</i>

389
00:38:49,869 --> 00:38:51,495
You're different.

390
00:38:56,959 --> 00:38:58,419
And when I'm with you,

391
00:39:00,880 --> 00:39:02,340
I feel so safe.

392
00:39:11,432 --> 00:39:12,808
<i>I love you.</i>

393
00:39:14,935 --> 00:39:18,105
[Natalie] I love you…

394
00:39:19,815 --> 00:39:20,900
so much.

395
00:39:21,984 --> 00:39:23,527
<i>Please love me too.</i>

396
00:39:58,145 --> 00:40:02,441
[foreboding music playing]

397
00:40:07,279 --> 00:40:08,322
[sighs]

398
00:40:18,290 --> 00:40:21,043
Oh, how I loved you, Helena.

399
00:40:22,420 --> 00:40:23,629
How I loved you.

400
00:40:26,882 --> 00:40:29,969
But love makes people weak!

401
00:40:32,388 --> 00:40:35,975
And I must never be weak.

402
00:40:39,311 --> 00:40:41,772
And you of all people should know that.

403
00:40:46,569 --> 00:40:48,237
You went too far.

404
00:41:07,548 --> 00:41:09,884
You and Grandma could have been
a power couple.

405
00:41:13,596 --> 00:41:16,348
It's just too bad,
the dragon played with fire

406
00:41:16,432 --> 00:41:18,309
and she got burned.

407
00:41:20,102 --> 00:41:25,774
Traitors pay a steep price!

408
00:41:30,237 --> 00:41:31,238
How's Mom?

409
00:41:38,913 --> 00:41:39,997
She's a big girl.

410
00:41:41,165 --> 00:41:44,668
Your mom is a very strong woman.

411
00:41:46,754 --> 00:41:48,631
[sighs] She'll get through this.

412
00:41:49,882 --> 00:41:51,592
She'll soon forget…

413
00:41:53,219 --> 00:41:55,387
the deaths of your father and grandmother.

414
00:41:57,264 --> 00:41:58,432
One thing is for sure,

415
00:42:00,476 --> 00:42:02,811
she'll never suspect…

416
00:42:04,939 --> 00:42:06,857
that I killed her mother.

417
00:42:08,734 --> 00:42:09,902
You know what's funny?

418
00:42:12,279 --> 00:42:15,157
We abducted Lily and Camia Cruz,

419
00:42:16,200 --> 00:42:19,453
toyed with them, and tried to kill them,

420
00:42:21,413 --> 00:42:22,748
but in the end,

421
00:42:25,834 --> 00:42:27,253
we're the ones who lost lives.

422
00:42:29,713 --> 00:42:32,758
I mean, come on, you must admit,
we got a taste of karma.

423
00:42:37,471 --> 00:42:39,181
No, my son.

424
00:42:40,558 --> 00:42:42,685
The death of your grandmother

425
00:42:43,811 --> 00:42:47,898
is what you call a blessing in disguise.

426
00:42:49,942 --> 00:42:51,527
Now that she's dead,

427
00:42:52,695 --> 00:42:54,822
even if her ghost haunts us,

428
00:42:56,532 --> 00:43:01,912
she won't be able to stop us
from claiming her wealth.

429
00:43:04,498 --> 00:43:06,792
So, what belongs to her,

430
00:43:08,377 --> 00:43:12,006
now completely belongs to us.

431
00:43:34,987 --> 00:43:38,490
-[Emilia] <i>Mama.</i>
-[Helena] <i>Emilia, my daughter.</i>

432
00:43:40,492 --> 00:43:42,745
[Emilia] <i>I've waited all these years.</i>

433
00:43:44,163 --> 00:43:46,332
[Helena] <i>Not longer</i>
<i>than I've waited, Emilia.</i>

434
00:43:46,915 --> 00:43:48,000
[Emilia] <i>Are these all mine?!</i>

435
00:43:48,083 --> 00:43:49,710
[Helena] <i>I'll get you the crown back.</i>

436
00:43:50,002 --> 00:43:52,212
<i>You will be the queen of Ardiente!</i>

437
00:43:52,504 --> 00:43:54,506
<i>I would like to introduce to you</i>

438
00:43:54,590 --> 00:43:58,969
<i>my long-lost daughter,</i>
<i>Emilia Ardiente-Torillo!</i>

439
00:44:27,956 --> 00:44:29,416
[Arnaldo] Dad was not perfect.

440
00:44:30,959 --> 00:44:32,169
Nobody is perfect.

441
00:44:32,252 --> 00:44:34,963
But he tried his best to be a father to me

442
00:44:36,298 --> 00:44:37,299
and to my brother.

443
00:44:38,967 --> 00:44:40,552
We loved him as our father.

444
00:44:54,942 --> 00:44:57,236
Dad, your dream finally came true.

445
00:44:59,488 --> 00:45:01,281
The two of us have reconciled as brothers.

446
00:45:06,703 --> 00:45:07,996
We love you very much.

447
00:45:11,083 --> 00:45:12,709
Yes, Dad. We love you so much.

448
00:45:15,129 --> 00:45:16,505
We'll see you in heaven.

449
00:45:21,677 --> 00:45:27,349
[soft dramatic music playing]

450
00:46:23,363 --> 00:46:25,365
[soft dramatic music continues playing]

451
00:46:37,002 --> 00:46:38,795
[Emilia] <i>Step aside! Stop!</i>

452
00:46:38,879 --> 00:46:40,756
<i>I'll bury my husband myself!</i>

453
00:46:40,839 --> 00:46:43,133
<i>Fine! Accompany his grave!</i>

454
00:46:43,217 --> 00:46:44,968
[people yelling]

455
00:46:45,594 --> 00:46:48,514
[Julio] <i>Lily Cruz is the real Red Dragon!</i>

456
00:46:48,597 --> 00:46:49,848
<i>She is the real criminal!</i>

457
00:46:49,932 --> 00:46:51,892
[Damian] <i>Don't believe Julio Ardiente.</i>

458
00:46:51,975 --> 00:46:52,851
<i>I am the Jaguar.</i>

459
00:46:52,935 --> 00:46:55,854
<i>I used to work for Red Dragon.</i>
<i>I know the entire truth.</i>

460
00:46:55,938 --> 00:46:59,191
[Arnaldo] <i>It's time to create</i>
<i>a new nightmare for them.</i>

461
00:46:59,274 --> 00:47:02,486
<i>Julio had something to do</i>
<i>with Helena's death.</i>

462
00:47:02,569 --> 00:47:06,490
<i>Now, the question is, who is helping him?</i>

463
00:47:07,616 --> 00:47:10,911
[theme music playing]
